      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "1. Age verification doesn't help predator in any way directly, age verification is mostly used to tell other user that said user is above the age of 18 years old. Not having said badge doesn't really mean you are possibly a minor if you do not have the badge. It's just a way for others to know that said user is \"trustworthy\".\n\n2. Age verified instance are a thing already and if you are age verified you will see these instances quite a lot. Not entirely sure on what change you'd like to see involving this aspect?\n\n3. Persona doesn't really seem to be a shady company at the moment, they are used by reddit, linkedin and other platform that are used by millions of users. Of course it is a privacy issue since you are giving your personal information to a company, but these information are deleted as soon your verification is completed. I've tried before to reapply for the age verification on an alt account and it wouldn't let me do it since I already did it in the past. \n\nPersona when verifying your age deletes your information and generate a unique irreversible digital fingerprint (hash) your ID and selfie data. Your information are not kept raw on Persona website.\n\nPlease refer to this article on Persona website about their privacy and security feature : https://withpersona.com/security",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
