      "value": "@{6260c8afee7e23528a83fd0f|full_name} \n\n1. Sadly making the game entierely behind age verification will destroy the game, it has been the cased on many other VR games that tried this path and VRChat is taking actions with these kind of behaviour that certain users have. They recently made a video talking about age verification and what they are planning on doing in 2026 : https://youtu.be/PQaeFS0Wfr8?si=nbDnnXi0DduGmMNA. \n\n2. You need to share your ID to Persona or else you will not be verified, they have to look at it to make sure it is a really ID and not a fake one.\n\n2. You cannot verify yourself if they deleted it, they have some accreditation that they need to follow or else they can lose them, I am not entirely sure how they work, but it's just a question of trust as a user of their platform.",
