      "value": "@{6283e1007316fe0b7ef81f7f|full_name} I'm not gonna say \"I WAS THE RIGHT ONE\".  But, I suggest people that we should always assume this is the way things end like. Always. Sigh.\n\nI was shocked that it *looks like* something far beyond is happening.\n\nThey always claim 'Trust us'. Never trust anybody online. If they don't get your info, things wouldn't happen easily.",
